author=XxxY
description=Fully mountless module loading on the Prism engine: hookless VFS injection, RRO overlays included — no overlayfs, no binds, no tmpfs. su is external (sucompat). ⚠️ Leave the manager's "umount modules" switches OFF; nothing here is a mount, so they hide nothing — use `nomount uid block <pkg>` to hide from an app. 🫥
metamodule=1
